        "mission_intent": "Subject: Risk Assessment Documentation for FY2024 ICFR Audit Planning\n\nHi team, as we kick off planning for the FY2024 integrated audit, I need us to build out the preliminary risk assessment workpapers that will drive our scoping decisions for the audit of internal control over financial reporting, consistent with AS 2201 requirements. Specifically, please document our evaluation of each engagement's risk profile by considering the following factors: our preliminary judgments about ICFR effectiveness, any publicly available information bearing on the likelihood of material misstatements, insights from our client acceptance and retention evaluations, and the relative complexity of each company's operations. For the complexity assessment, make sure we flag entities that exhibit characteristics of less complex operations\u2014things like fewer business lines, centralized accounting functions, heavy senior management involvement in daily operations, simpler financial reporting systems, and flatter management structures with wide spans of control. I'd like this risk assessment to feed directly into our determination of significant accounts and relevant assertions, so please ensure the documentation is robust enough to support downstream scoping. Have the preliminary workpapers loaded into TeamMate by end of next week so the engagement leaders can review before our planning meetings.",
